      "writtenOn": "2020-03-03T21:37:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could break cases where code in the 29-targeting APEXes throw exceptions in HWASAN builds, and also wastes a bit of disk space.\n\nWhy are you making this change? Ah - is it because the rest of the change causes link failures otherwise? What do you think about going in the other direction and only using the older stubs in unbundled builds?",
      "revId": "a095cda3ebfa0185c9dd7de269ba94857aa5ca52",
