      "writtenOn": "2020-03-04T06:23:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "UnbundledBuild condition has moved to when setting MinSdkVersion. min_sdk_version is respected only when unbundled build or for updatable modules. Otherwise MinSdkVersion is set to FutureApiRelease(10000) so that the latest version of stubs is chosen.",
      "parentUuid": "9f352701_414e180e",
      "revId": "a095cda3ebfa0185c9dd7de269ba94857aa5ca52",
